WEBVTT

00:04.060 --> 00:06.840
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:07.670 --> 00:12.420
Nadja, guided by
destiny, arrived in France.

00:16.640 --> 00:17.440
- NAAJA
- Nadja,

00:18.000 --> 00:19.270
With your eyes

00:19.271 --> 00:20.539
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:20.540 --> 00:21.750
- Nadja,
- NAAJA

00:21.753 --> 00:22.880
What do you see?

00:22.881 --> 00:24.010
Nani ga mieru

00:24.210 --> 00:25.650
Shining in the far distance,

00:25.651 --> 00:27.090
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:27.220 --> 00:28.325
The door to the future,

00:28.326 --> 00:29.430
Mirai no tobira

00:30.320 --> 00:31.940
That's what I'm searching for

00:31.941 --> 00:33.560
Sagashite iru

00:33.590 --> 00:40.970
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:33.740 --> 00:41.120
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:41.660 --> 00:43.540
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:43.541 --> 00:45.420
Minna egao de aetara

00:45.540 --> 00:48.790
- I'm sure there would be no more fighting
- Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:48.920 --> 00:50.525
It could be so much more fun

00:50.526 --> 00:52.130
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.210 --> 00:53.920
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:53.921 --> 00:55.630
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.050 --> 00:57.700
I can't see the end of the journey

00:57.701 --> 00:59.350
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.390 --> 01:02.720
- God is the only one who could
possibly know - Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:02.850 --> 01:06.440
- To the people who, someday, I will meet
again - Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:06.443 --> 01:07.500
I will go waving

01:07.501 --> 01:08.560
Te wo furinagara

01:08.860 --> 01:12.175
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:12.176 --> 01:15.489
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.490 --> 01:16.845
But I won't look back

01:16.846 --> 01:18.200
Ushiro mukanai

01:18.450 --> 01:20.930
Until the day my dream comes true

01:20.931 --> 01:23.410
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:23.660 --> 01:25.370
Nadja, Your smile

01:25.371 --> 01:27.079
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.080 --> 01:28.750
Nadja, gives me courage

01:28.751 --> 01:30.420
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:30.630 --> 01:32.090
Under the blue sky,

01:32.091 --> 01:33.549
Aoi sora no shita de

01:33.550 --> 01:34.965
I will find the place

01:34.966 --> 01:36.380
Ashita no yukue

01:36.970 --> 01:38.785
where my future lies

01:38.786 --> 01:40.600
Mitsukeru kara

01:49.580 --> 01:52.600
In my dream

01:53.100 --> 01:56.420
I hear the sound of rain

01:56.530 --> 02:02.680
I opened my eyes

02:03.410 --> 02:06.790
Blessed rain fell on the parched earth

02:06.890 --> 02:10.380
The trees and grass
call out their gratitude

02:10.480 --> 02:13.660
In my place

02:13.910 --> 02:16.580
For I

02:16.600 --> 02:19.700
Have lost my voice

02:24.310 --> 02:27.690
The darkness I saw
when I looked up is so deep

02:27.710 --> 02:31.250
I can't see anything

02:31.310 --> 02:34.400
Just the falling rain

02:34.780 --> 02:37.360
As if in grief

02:38.360 --> 02:40.670
On a night like this

02:40.710 --> 02:45.100
Prayers would only freeze

02:45.400 --> 02:48.040
This chipped and cracked heart

02:48.150 --> 02:54.480
Will never be moist again

02:54.740 --> 02:58.010
If your

02:58.280 --> 03:03.000
Smile is not there

03:09.250 --> 03:13.100
Broken Wing and Tears of Love

03:29.380 --> 03:30.380
Nobles.

03:33.140 --> 03:36.440
<i>I wonder if Francis
watches things like operas?</i>

03:44.720 --> 03:45.910
W-Wh–

03:50.020 --> 03:51.140
Who is that?

03:59.920 --> 04:01.460
See you, Sylvie.

04:25.440 --> 04:26.440
Raphael.

04:31.470 --> 04:33.720
To celebrate our reunion with Raphael,

04:33.900 --> 04:35.740
Cheers!

04:36.480 --> 04:37.999
Hey, Raphael.

04:38.000 --> 04:39.540
You're a minstrel, right?

04:39.920 --> 04:42.120
What's a "minstrel"?

04:43.230 --> 04:45.810
I drift from country to
country like the wind,

04:45.870 --> 04:47.000
singing my heart out.

04:47.030 --> 04:49.100
That is a minstrel.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.460
Hmm... to sing one's heart out.

04:52.580 --> 04:55.370
For example, my heart right now says:

04:57.400 --> 05:00.680
"Birds that continue to
fly by riding on the wind..."

05:00.740 --> 05:02.360
"Birds that continue to fly..."

05:02.410 --> 05:03.320
<i>Wow.</i>

05:03.360 --> 05:05.000
"rest their wings for just a moment."

05:03.600 --> 05:05.520
<i>He's composing that song right here.</i>

05:06.800 --> 05:10.690
"On this tree where warm sunlight falls."

05:11.350 --> 05:13.220
I don't get it at all!

05:14.170 --> 05:18.030
That's great Raphael! I'm greatly moved!

05:18.050 --> 05:21.060
Geez, drunks are impressed by everything.

05:21.080 --> 05:22.600
Ah? What did you say?

05:22.670 --> 05:25.440
Are you making fun of Raphael?

05:25.520 --> 05:27.220
That's not what I meant.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.280
Master!

05:41.910 --> 05:43.220
Francis.

06:06.150 --> 06:07.220
A dream?

06:17.510 --> 06:19.010
Could this place be...

06:19.170 --> 06:20.170
an opera house?

06:20.420 --> 06:21.420
That's right.

06:24.220 --> 06:25.540
He's not here, is he?

06:27.060 --> 06:28.060
Ah?!

06:29.140 --> 06:30.390
Francis!

06:31.430 --> 06:32.430
Eh?

06:33.390 --> 06:34.430
I'm sorry!

06:36.750 --> 06:39.560
Francis can't possibly be in Paris, can he?

06:39.580 --> 06:41.399
Nadja, try to keep up.

06:41.400 --> 06:43.760
Y-Yes. Sylvie, wait for me.

06:44.720 --> 06:47.180
Sylvie, are you worried about something?

06:47.720 --> 06:49.400
Did something happen with your lover?

06:49.480 --> 06:50.400
Lover?

06:50.420 --> 06:52.260
You went out with him
yesterday, didn't you?

06:52.500 --> 06:55.600
He's just the Dandelion
Troupe's good customer.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.240
He's not really a lover.

06:57.560 --> 06:58.960
Hmm? Is that so.

06:59.220 --> 07:01.630
Well, who is it that you like, Sylvie?

07:03.400 --> 07:05.540
You have someone you like, don't you?

07:08.130 --> 07:10.860
I don't... have anyone like that.

07:11.070 --> 07:12.800
Who is "Francis"?

07:13.500 --> 07:15.980
How do you know about Francis?!

07:16.050 --> 07:17.600
You mentioned him in your sleep.

07:17.660 --> 07:19.560
You even dream about him, huh?

07:21.180 --> 07:23.840
No! That's completely...

07:24.520 --> 07:25.680
Really?

07:26.590 --> 07:29.690
Hey. Who is it, the man you like?

07:29.710 --> 07:31.000
You're starting to nag.

07:31.010 --> 07:33.280
It's all right. It's just us girls.

07:33.340 --> 07:35.160
Hey, I said, hey.

07:35.650 --> 07:36.850
You won't tell anyone?

07:37.180 --> 07:38.030
Yup.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.160
It's a promise!

07:39.700 --> 07:40.700
Who is it?

07:43.000 --> 07:44.080
Him.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.620
"Him"?

07:48.010 --> 07:49.120
The angel?

07:49.710 --> 07:52.500
I'm... in love with an angel.

07:52.690 --> 07:53.690
Oh...

07:53.790 --> 07:57.040
But no matter how many times
I reach out, I'll never touch him.

07:58.290 --> 07:59.290
Because...

07:59.540 --> 08:00.860
he flies away.

08:01.630 --> 08:03.400
Umm, that means...

08:03.450 --> 08:04.880
Well, let's head home.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.720
Ahh, wait up!

08:13.860 --> 08:15.680
<i>In love with an angel.</i>

08:16.870 --> 08:18.720
<i>I wonder what that means?</i>

08:20.780 --> 08:21.780
<i>Love.</i>

08:26.110 --> 08:27.760
Ah, Francis!

08:30.590 --> 08:31.590
Dummy.

08:31.730 --> 08:32.860
Nadja!

08:33.530 --> 08:34.860
What are you doing?

08:35.000 --> 08:36.620
No... Nothing.

08:37.880 --> 08:40.750
Mr. Abel, have you ever seen an angel?

08:41.140 --> 08:42.360
An angel?

08:43.080 --> 08:46.060
I have. He's right nearby, isn't he? Look.

09:00.150 --> 09:01.790
Hey, am I right?

09:09.090 --> 09:10.300
It's Raphael, right?

09:11.330 --> 09:14.820
Raphael has the same name
as the Archangel Raphael.

09:16.450 --> 09:17.780
I'm right, aren't I?

09:17.990 --> 09:19.040
Sylvie.

09:19.990 --> 09:22.900
I'm on my way to have dinner with a client.

09:22.990 --> 09:25.770
With a beautiful woman
around, business goes smoother.

09:29.500 --> 09:30.940
It's all right if you don't want to.

09:32.250 --> 09:33.250
Well...

09:33.660 --> 09:35.560
I wonder what you plan to buy for me?

09:35.580 --> 09:38.060
I found a great shop in
Montmartre. Now, let's go.

09:39.020 --> 09:40.130
Sylvie?

10:01.300 --> 10:03.640
Frustrated by love

10:03.890 --> 10:06.020
I sleep

10:04.430 --> 10:06.080
I see Raphael!

10:06.580 --> 10:10.020
In the deep of night

10:10.630 --> 10:11.920
What a beautiful song.

10:12.800 --> 10:16.300
It's strange, my heart
warms up listening to it.

10:16.400 --> 10:19.340
It comes from a heart born of tears.

10:16.510 --> 10:19.280
I looked up

10:19.420 --> 10:25.020
People who have felt pain and sadness
have very gentle hearts, you know?

10:19.600 --> 10:21.660
At the stars

10:21.720 --> 10:23.800
That twinkle in the sky

10:25.170 --> 10:26.370
Granny.

10:26.690 --> 10:32.220
Raphael's song is famous
for giving luck to love affairs.

10:32.730 --> 10:34.050
Love affairs?

10:34.051 --> 10:37.180
I used up all my thoughts

10:34.110 --> 10:35.140
That's right.

10:35.320 --> 10:38.665
If Raphael sings for you, you will
be able to be with the one you love.

10:38.666 --> 10:41.700
For that dream I dreamt to the end

10:39.590 --> 10:41.010
Or so I've heard.

10:45.800 --> 10:49.860
Please bring it to me

10:50.320 --> 10:54.420
My wings.

11:01.930 --> 11:02.930
Hmm?

11:03.300 --> 11:06.700
Raphael, I wonder if you
can sing a song for me.

11:13.660 --> 11:16.460
A friend of mine is in love.

11:16.480 --> 11:19.720
If you sing for her, maybe
that love will come true.

11:20.780 --> 11:22.300
That's why... please?

11:23.760 --> 11:24.780
Nadja.

11:25.150 --> 11:27.620
I think you have truly beautiful wings.

11:29.400 --> 11:30.400
Wings?

11:30.780 --> 11:31.870
All people...

11:32.090 --> 11:34.570
have invisible wings.

11:35.520 --> 11:38.100
The wings are that person's
strength, and courage...

11:38.870 --> 11:40.720
and also their compassionate hearts.

11:41.260 --> 11:44.560
The size, color, and
shape may be different...

11:45.010 --> 11:47.560
but there's definitely a
pair on everyone's back.

11:48.430 --> 11:54.100
Your wings are warm and beautiful,
like your heart which cares for a friend.

11:56.660 --> 12:00.940
Somehow, I feel embarrassed
when you say that to my face.

12:04.840 --> 12:07.780
What kind of wings are yours, Raphael?

12:11.220 --> 12:13.900
I'm sure they're really big wings!

12:14.170 --> 12:17.780
Because, you have the courage
to travel the world all by yourself!

12:19.470 --> 12:22.680
My wings... are broken.

12:29.560 --> 12:30.640
I'll sing.

12:30.960 --> 12:32.610
For your friend.

12:54.390 --> 12:55.620
Nadja.

12:56.490 --> 12:57.610
Sylvie.

12:57.830 --> 12:59.090
Let's go home together.

12:59.740 --> 13:01.420
I can get home by myself.

13:01.500 --> 13:02.860
I'm not a child, you know.

13:03.240 --> 13:05.700
You're in love with Raphael, aren't you?

13:06.150 --> 13:08.520
Why don't you say anything?

13:13.310 --> 13:15.440
It's not like you to run away, Sylvie.

13:16.380 --> 13:17.850
And if it were you,

13:17.910 --> 13:19.340
what would you say to him?

13:19.470 --> 13:20.470
Eh?

13:21.710 --> 13:22.880
For example...

13:23.070 --> 13:25.840
Say, if you were in love with Francis.

13:27.040 --> 13:29.450
I don't feel anything special for Francis.

13:30.890 --> 13:32.760
I'm just saying "if".

13:32.920 --> 13:34.360
Would you tell him you were?

13:35.230 --> 13:38.700
Even if Francis might
not feel anything for you.

13:39.230 --> 13:40.230
Eh?

13:40.370 --> 13:43.040
Because, you only danced once, right?

13:43.120 --> 13:44.240
He might...

13:44.570 --> 13:48.000
not even remember you anymore.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.970
That's not...

13:53.040 --> 13:54.530
It's all right, isn't it?

13:54.810 --> 13:56.780
You don't love him or anything, right?

14:04.790 --> 14:07.300
Who knows, you might never see him again.

14:09.040 --> 14:10.040
Never...

14:10.720 --> 14:11.800
see him again?

14:12.880 --> 14:15.600
We don't know when
we'll visit England again.

14:15.780 --> 14:19.860
Even if we went to England, you
don't know if Francis will be there.

14:20.440 --> 14:23.070
There's no guarantee that
your love will be returned.

14:25.740 --> 14:27.390
No matter how much you love him.

14:28.710 --> 14:30.330
Love?

14:31.260 --> 14:33.740
You love him, don't you? Francis.

14:33.790 --> 14:35.500
That's why you're crying, isn't it?

14:40.720 --> 14:41.960
Oh no! Why am I?

14:41.980 --> 14:43.140
Why?

14:47.280 --> 14:49.660
Isn't it because you can't see Francis?

14:50.020 --> 14:53.000
You were constantly
looking for him, weren't you?

14:55.160 --> 14:56.940
I want to see him.

15:01.830 --> 15:04.280
I want to see Francis!

15:20.640 --> 15:22.900
Falling in love with someone,

15:23.100 --> 15:25.360
it isn't always joy and laughter.

15:25.570 --> 15:27.230
There are painful things too.

15:29.700 --> 15:31.870
Sylvie, are you in pain too?

15:32.310 --> 15:33.840
Hey, Nadja?

15:33.900 --> 15:36.300
What if you confessed your
feelings to the person you loved,

15:36.420 --> 15:40.040
and that was troublesome for
that person. What would you do?

15:41.860 --> 15:43.240
Raphael...

15:43.900 --> 15:45.500
had someone he loved.

15:51.920 --> 15:55.640
It seems, the girl he loved
was the daughter of a noble.

15:56.060 --> 16:01.280
Being two people from different classes,
their marriage was not permissible.

16:01.450 --> 16:05.410
The two threw everything away and eloped.

16:08.530 --> 16:09.430
But, the girl fell ill,
and she passed away.

16:22.960 --> 16:24.460
Raphael said:

16:28.370 --> 16:30.540
"If only she had not met me,"

16:30.580 --> 16:36.140
"I'm sure she would be
alive and living happily."

16:40.330 --> 16:43.690
That–! That isn't Raphael's fault!

16:44.330 --> 16:47.480
Yes. But he believes
he did something wrong.

16:48.160 --> 16:52.260
That's why he said he won't
get married in the future.

16:53.820 --> 16:56.340
He said he will never love anyone again.

17:02.620 --> 17:06.440
That's why I was rejected.

17:06.770 --> 17:07.900
Do you understand?

17:09.420 --> 17:12.300
He will never love anyone again?

17:12.540 --> 17:13.840
It's so sad!

17:19.560 --> 17:22.250
For myself, I can see Raphael's wings.

17:22.690 --> 17:26.370
Like an angel's beautiful,
silver coloured wings.

17:26.450 --> 17:27.450
But...

17:27.900 --> 17:32.160
He lost the courage to love,
and one wing was broken.

17:32.340 --> 17:34.640
I thought, "I could heal him."

17:34.660 --> 17:36.980
But it seems useless.

17:39.680 --> 17:43.440
It's going to get dark
soon. Hurry and head home.

17:43.910 --> 17:46.500
I'm going to be fine by myself.

17:52.650 --> 17:54.200
Let's go home together!

17:54.650 --> 17:55.740
Nadja...

17:55.840 --> 17:57.640
You like Raphael, don't you?

17:57.710 --> 18:00.080
You really want to see him, don't you?

18:00.210 --> 18:01.660
He's so close.

18:01.780 --> 18:03.530
You're able to, so go see him!

18:04.490 --> 18:08.960
I don't think Raphael is the type
to think you're a burden, Sylvie.

18:09.340 --> 18:10.560
If this goes on,

18:10.900 --> 18:13.170
you'll only get hurt even more.

18:16.150 --> 18:17.520
Sylvie!

18:18.000 --> 18:19.820
You sure are a strange girl.

18:20.110 --> 18:23.840
Why do you try so hard for my sake?

18:24.810 --> 18:26.870
Am I that strange?

18:27.720 --> 18:29.410
You're <i>very</i> strange.

18:39.570 --> 18:41.310
Raphael!

18:44.210 --> 18:46.420
Hey there, cheerful Nadja.

18:52.720 --> 18:53.860
Sylvie.

19:19.890 --> 19:22.490
My unfolded

19:22.510 --> 19:25.080
Wings

19:25.130 --> 19:29.300
Will not reach.

19:30.300 --> 19:32.900
I look up,

19:32.920 --> 19:35.160
And the sky

19:35.430 --> 19:40.500
Is too far away.

19:43.380 --> 19:45.709
I, who can not fly,

19:45.710 --> 19:46.860
Sylvie.

19:48.370 --> 19:52.760
Search for wings,

19:53.540 --> 19:58.300
And wander on foot

19:58.400 --> 20:02.510
Upon this earth.

20:04.280 --> 20:07.840
Oh, blue sky!

20:07.870 --> 20:09.919
Together with the clouds,

20:09.920 --> 20:11.839
How far must I go...

20:11.840 --> 20:14.740
Ah, I follow you,

20:14.850 --> 20:18.580
How far must I go

20:18.740 --> 20:20.839
To find peace?

20:20.840 --> 20:24.920
My heart.

20:25.140 --> 20:27.620
Oh, cold

20:27.670 --> 20:30.030
Wind,

20:30.290 --> 20:32.519
Take this feeling.

20:32.520 --> 20:34.970
When mimosas were blooming in Paris,

20:34.990 --> 20:36.330
where were you?

20:36.331 --> 20:37.399
I am

20:37.400 --> 20:39.355
In the deep snow.

20:39.356 --> 20:40.660
Tired.

20:40.680 --> 20:45.770
Broken wings of mine...

20:41.240 --> 20:44.740
Have you ever seen a
field of flowers in the snow?

20:45.330 --> 20:46.400
Just once.

20:46.401 --> 20:47.759
I wish you to deliver me

20:47.760 --> 20:48.780
Someday,

20:49.690 --> 20:51.030
I'd like to go see it.

20:52.980 --> 20:57.320
To my love.

20:59.100 --> 21:02.640
Oh, blue moon!

21:02.660 --> 21:05.105
Together with the stars

21:05.106 --> 21:06.839
All this darkness

21:06.840 --> 21:09.599
Ah, covers everything

21:09.600 --> 21:13.100
All this darkness

21:13.570 --> 21:15.660
Wipe it away

21:15.690 --> 21:19.890
My heart

21:19.950 --> 21:22.560
Oh, Light.

21:22.600 --> 21:25.020
Somehow,

21:25.070 --> 21:29.500
We'll meet again.

21:30.390 --> 21:32.560
For the sake

21:30.890 --> 21:32.520
Raphael left?!

21:32.550 --> 21:35.430
Yes, his lute and luggage
were gone when I woke up.

21:35.431 --> 21:41.160
Of my lover's smile,

21:35.470 --> 21:37.780
Where did he go? What's his destination?

21:37.810 --> 21:38.980
Who knows.

21:40.190 --> 21:41.250
"Who knows"?

21:41.251 --> 21:42.939
Please light the way

21:42.940 --> 21:44.040
Is this all right?

21:45.200 --> 21:47.500
That's just the way he is.

21:47.640 --> 21:53.100
To my love.

21:48.180 --> 21:50.250
I'll see him again somewhere.

21:52.020 --> 21:53.280
Same goes for you.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.180
Francis...

21:59.030 --> 22:00.580
I'll see you, won't I?

22:01.600 --> 22:04.760
I'll surely see you again, won't I?

22:14.470 --> 22:16.095
Paris is sunnier than London

22:16.096 --> 22:17.720
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:17.840 --> 22:20.930
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:21.350 --> 22:24.435
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:24.436 --> 22:27.520
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:28.480 --> 22:29.720
- Indeed
- Kitto

22:32.480 --> 22:34.900
- It's not use worrying about it
- Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:35.480 --> 22:37.045
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:37.046 --> 22:38.610
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:38.870 --> 22:41.225
Tomorrow's going to
be whatever it was meant

22:41.226 --> 22:43.580
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:43.660 --> 22:45.040
- To be, to be
- Naru naru

22:45.370 --> 22:47.875
The tree fog won

22:47.876 --> 22:50.380
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:50.840 --> 22:52.800
The world frog-jumping contest

22:52.801 --> 22:54.760
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:57.970 --> 23:01.055
Under the kitten's paw

23:01.056 --> 23:04.140
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:04.560 --> 23:07.645
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:07.646 --> 23:10.730
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:13.570 --> 23:15.235
Paris is sunnier than London

23:15.236 --> 23:16.900
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:16.990 --> 23:19.990
- Carmen likes paella more than pasta
- CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:20.490 --> 23:23.680
It's not the time to hang around

23:23.681 --> 23:26.870
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:27.750 --> 23:30.000
Indeed, indeed

23:30.001 --> 23:32.250
Kitto kitto

23:39.980 --> 23:40.980
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:41.981 --> 23:43.349
A flood of sound.

23:43.350 --> 23:44.959
An undulating timbre.

23:44.960 --> 23:48.070
A gentle and beautiful melody.

23:48.530 --> 23:51.030
The young genius composer, John.

23:51.410 --> 23:53.360
But despite that, he has a big problem.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.699
But you know, John,

23:55.700 --> 24:00.120
"It's no use worrying
about it. Que sera sera."

24:00.600 --> 24:02.010
"Sera sera."

24:02.560 --> 24:03.755
Tomorrow's Nadja:

24:03.756 --> 24:05.720
The Troubled Genius Pianist.

24:03.960 --> 24:06.325
The Troubled Genius Pianist.

24:06.326 --> 24:07.820
Now, the Door of Destiny opens.
